  "description": "Bell, though beautiful, lives as a “courtesan” for the nobility due to his lowly status. Having witnessed the vile desires of countless nobles, Bell becomes curious about the impeccably perfect Earl Enoch Benedict. Realizing that Enoch, of all people, is hiding the most vulgar desires, Bell resolves to thoroughly trample him underfoot—just as he wishes.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
